# Heavy media. These are served from S3 in every environment
# (NEXT_PUBLIC_ASSET_BASE_URL), so committing ~65MB of binaries would bloat the
# repo permanently for no gain. Re-upload with `npm run sync:assets` after
# replacing one. The two at the project root are stray source copies.
/Gif file.gif
/WEBSITE VIDEO.mp4
/public/WEBSITE VIDEO.mp4
/public/process-depth.gif
